  (descr "Hirose FX23L-80S-0.5SV(20), LCSC C2911203, 80-pin 0.5 mm board-to-board receptacle with four power contacts, the mate of the FX23L-80P-0.5SV8 on the Satellite1 HAT's J7. Drawn for chorus-main from FutureProofHomes' shoe rev 1 3D model and checked against Hirose's own model of the part; signal pads 1-40 on the +y row and 41-80 on the -y row, each from +x. Which power contact is ground is not confirmed: see README.md before ordering.")
